      </memberdef>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Class representing the <ref refid="structastrea_1_1astro_1_1frames_1_1Perifocal" kindref="compound">Perifocal</ref> (PQW) frame: P towards periapsis, W along the angular momentum vector, and Q completing the right-handed triad in the orbital plane. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unlike VNB/RIC/LVLH, the perifocal frame&apos;s orientation is fixed for a given (unperturbed) orbit <ndash/> it depends only on the orbital plane and the location of periapsis, not on where the satellite currently is along the orbit. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
